# Appendix B — Project Milestone Rubrics
AI-Enabled Informatics for Engineers (Spring 2026)

Each milestone builds one layer of a real informatics system.
Grades emphasize *decision quality, realism, and clarity*.

---

## M0 — Domain Shortlist (Week 1, Ungraded)

**Deliverable:**  
3 domains + 1 decision per domain (Canvas post)

Checklist:
- Decision = action, not prediction
- At least one public dataset plausible

---

## M1 — Problem Definition (Week 2)

**Deliverable:**
- Domain + stakeholder
- One decision statement
- Dataset plan + link
- Success criteria

**Grading (100 pts)**

| Category | Points |
|--------|------|
| Decision clarity | 30 |
| Dataset realism | 30 |
| Success criteria | 20 |
| Communication | 20 |

Resources:
- Kaggle datasets: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets

---

